<h3>Limit</h3>
<p>The <code>LimitExecutor</code> constrains the number of output tuples fr=
om its child executor. If the number of tuples produced by its child execut=
or is less than the limit specified in the <code>LimitPlanNode</code>, this=
 executor has no effect and yields all of the tuples that it receives.</p>
